// Format Version: 1.0.0

// Doc
// 9|151 Timer for ability choice 1
// 9|152 Timer for ability choice 2
// 9|153 Timer for ability choice 3
// 9|154 Timer for ability choice 4
// 9|155 Timer for goal mode
// 9|100 control ability timers
// 9|101 control goal mode timer
// 9|0=1 grant one ability
// 9|0=2 display the choices messagebox
// 9|0=3 is a trigger for when you collect a pickup
// 9|0=4 is a trigger for when you collect a wisp
// 9|0=5 is a trigger for getting a new ability
// 9|0=6 is a trigger for rerolling all your current abilities
// 9|0=7 is a trigger for removing a skill
// 9|0=8 is a trigger for rerolling your choices
// 9|0=9 consume a reroll
// 9|0=10 pull 4 abilities choices
// 9|0=11 consume full reroll
// 9|0=12 set Grom prices
// 9|0=13 trigger for building the hint wheel
// 9|0=14 display Opher's advice 1
// 9|0=15 display Opher's spirit light
// 9|0=16 display Opher's roll info 1
// 9|0=17 display Opher's roll info 2
// 9|0=18 display Opher's permanent skill
// 9|0=19 display Opher's tree
// 9|0=20 display Opher's Grom
// 9|0=21 display Opher's Wisps
// 9|0=22 display Opher's Willow
// 9|0=23 adds binding 4 icons if you bought the upgrade
// 9|110 tracks if you can choose a new ability
// 9|111 tracks if you can choose between 4 abilities
// 9|112 tracks if you have 4 abilities
// 9|113 tracks if Grom discount is active
// 9|114 tracks if player exited willow's last room
// 9|114 also tracks if player exited willow's last room?
// 9|120 tracks if you bought Opher's advice 1
// 9|121 tracks if you bought Opher's SL
// 9|122 tracks if you bought Opher's roll information 1
// 9|123 tracks if you bought Opher's roll information 2
// 9|124 tracks if you bought Opher's permanent skill information
// 9|125 tracks if you bought Opher's tree information
// 9|126 tracks if you bought Opher's Grom information
// 9|127 tracks if you bought Opher's wisps information
// 9|128 tracks if you bought Opher's willow information
// 9|130 tracks if you bought permanent burrow
// 9|131 tracks if you bought permanent regen
// 9|1 store the ability you'll get by pressing Binding 1
// 9|2 store the ability you'll get by pressing Binding 2
// 9|3 store the ability you'll get by pressing Binding 3
// 9|4 store the ability you'll get by pressing Binding 4
// 9|9 store the ability you've chosen
// 9|10 store the 4th ability slot if you bought the upgrade 
// 9|11 store the newest ability you've collected
// 9|12 store the second to last ability you've collected
// 9|13 store the oldest ability you've collected
// 9|14 store the ability which got removed
// 9|15 value used to delete a skill
// 9|20 number of pickups I care about (about everything except shops)
// 9|21 number of wisps collected
// 9|30 number of rerolls you have left
// 9|31 number of full rerolls you have left
// 9|50 store the number of abilities you still have to choose

