////    9|0=14 display Opher's advice 1
9|0=14|6|If you don't want to get stuck, you should probably keep some easy to access pickups at all time.\nThat way you always have a solution to a bad ability set.|f=500
////    9|0=15 display Opher's spirit light
9|0=15|6|Spirit Light is pretty hard to get by nowadays...\nIt seems like its only decent sources are Spirit Trials.|f=400
////    9|0=16 display Opher's roll info 1
9|0=16|6|This instability seems to follow some rules.\nI don't think it will let you chose an ability you already have right now.|f=400
////    9|0=17 display Opher's roll info 2
9|0=17|6|Motay noticed that some of your abilities are rarer than others.\nIf you get a powerful ability, you beter make it count!|f=400
////    9|0=18 display Opher's permanent skill
9|0=18|6|Grom can make some of your abilities permanent but he will need some Gorlek ores.\nHe says it'll also make rarer abilities more common.|f=600
////    9|0=19 display Opher's tree
9|0=19|6|Spirit Trees are oddly stable.\nI think all of them should give you the same abilities as normal.|f=400
////    9|0=20 display Opher's Grom
9|0=20|6|I heard that Grom is worried about the map pedestal in Ruins.\nHe might drop his price if you repair it?|f=400
////    9|0=21 display Opher's Wisps
9|0=21|6|The instability seems to have fused Wisps and Gorlek Ores.\nMotay thinks you'll get 5 Ores for each wisps and it should also restore the Glades.|f=600
////    9|0=22 display Opher's Willow
9|0=22|6|Willow is definitely the most unstable place of Niwen.\nI think you'll go through a massive change when you'll break its corrupted hearts.|f=600
////    9|0=23 adds Binding4 to the plando wheel if you bought the upgrade
9|0=23|4|17|9|111|1|16|0|0|2|Choice 4
